span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="2cdb2968-253a-4221-9b8c-aad61476bcde">complex()</span> function.</p><p data-ref="d6aefb52-cd7b-4665-803a-96d42783dcbc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="120eeec1-7e9e-4559-a36c-78929e91d757">Syntax:</strong></p><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false" data-ref="5bdc0699-dca5-4cb0-99f8-38bf1b313aa4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">complex(input())
