 black;" data-ref="6a24bd29-1a06-4b26-b05b-4850339798b8" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="0e515b95-ba2d-4017-b3e9-286b8d6a3212"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="c4034048-eb62-4a01-a6e3-0f59bf7761a5"><p data-ref="7088a5ae-5747-46ad-83f3-745ab90c14d1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Python program that checks if a given key exists in a dictionary.</p><p data-ref="084c6501-161a-4f0f-9e4f-db934806d262" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="65c04de5-cb18-4843-b21a-5b8bd3096527"></p><p data-ref="32a2cbc8-1d8e-4996-a53d-86d148badcac" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="62bdb993-9185-41ef-a5d1-278eaefd6a1a">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="d7b9a17f-47f2-4ef1-8ce7-a402a10a228b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-