ata-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="a72ef485-b2e8-4d41-bd6d-d11ef50d2c9b">The first line will contain the number of lines in the file, prefixed with "Lines:  "</li><li data-ref="c13af513-0f14-42ac-8d84-aaca74323e69">The second line will contain the number of words in the file, prefixed with "Words: "</li><li data-ref="32345a3f-fda8-4e55-a799-da4381d60b05">The third line will contain the number of characters in the file, prefixed with "Chars: "</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="20b6a82f-820d-468f-8a13-b4055648fc9b" data-split-to="20b6a82f-820d-468f-8a13-b4055648fc9b" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="17289cb5-e5d7-42af-adb3-8db9a6defd0e"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="351b087b-328e-46ec-8851-58af2e2c0794" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div><div class="user-solution" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="d9383326-4897-496a-b624-ba3486639946" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><div class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" style="font-family: monospace !important;border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; border: 1px solid black; break-after: avoid; page-break-after: avoid;" data-ref="f4233d1c-01d4-4a1b-b8c2-1f363f547932" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Count.py</div> <pre style="overflow: visible; border: 1px solid black; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 4px;" class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" data-ref="6f9bec8b-bcf0-44a7-9779-f74f4cbe7fc3" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">fp = input("file name:")
